    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="76.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 76.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ac ic hit forbeode heonon forð eornostlice ⁊ eac swyðe manega ðincg ðe Gode syndon swyðe laðe.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But I strictly forbid such a thing henceforth, and likewise very many things which are hateful to God.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ac ic hit forbeode heonon forð eornostlice ⁊ swylce manege, þe Gode syndon swyðe laþe.</ab>
      </div>
